|
| Syntax-demonstration class, converted from the ADLtest `openehr_adltest_100.bmm` ODIN
| schema. Illustrates a class with two open generic parameters, each constrained to
| descend from `SUPPLIER`.
|
class GENERIC_PARENT<T: SUPPLIER, U: SUPPLIER>
    is_a LOCATABLE

feature_group ("access")

    prop property_a :? T ;

    prop property_b :? U ;

end
